	(text "bus_adapter_eci: the 130XE/65XE cartridge + ECI slots to the 2x25 bus header (hardware/tools/bus_header.py), with the eci2Pbi adapter's mapping. ECI C1 (HALT from ANTIC) = READY, as on eci2Pbi: it halts the 6502 but isn't RDY (bank swaps need the RDY mod). No ECI pin for EXTDEC, CAS or RAS: open on the header."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
